          "id": "eth-notes-3",
          "type": "concept",
          "title": "AI Impact and Responsibility",
          "duration": 12,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                "AI can improve efficiency but can introduce bias and accountability concerns",
